:"UAZ33BKV2","text":"websocket受け手で「とりあえず文字にする」みたいなのが動いちゃってる感じな気がしますねえ","ts":"1620647803.418300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EOC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AAD8D128-8C80-4654-BC98-B5B79D77BF98","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なんでデコードできないって怒られるんだろ…","ts":"1620647715.417700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gvkBa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"417A4958-B97C-4BC9-9C6D-45CBA64B2B62","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"しんかさんの説明と概ね同じ理解でした","ts":"1620647677.417100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W1d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"100e0e22-ebc3-4a59-b56d-b19d5be751e6","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"kr/pty で websocket で標準入出力をまるっとやりとりするのは書いたことありますが、文字コードでハマった記憶はないですね、なんだろ...\n\u003chttps://github.com/iij/legs-client/blob/master/daemon/handler/message/console.go\u003e\nクライアント側の実装だけで参考になるかは分かりませんが、一応こんな感じに特に工夫してない気がします","ts":"1620647615.416300","thread_ts":"1620647615.416300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UzrRv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"decf290b-a621-4a4a-814a-0cd149d23587","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"なるほど。そう考えておけばANSIんですね","ts":"1620647372.413500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R05"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fbf1125-0d5d-40de-ab68-7a70ea5f6de6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そっちのほうが説明がすっきりですね、自分もそういう理解ですね","ts":"1620647309.412800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cQx0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfc56df4-023d-4fb8-a4af-132571442b6b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"端末難しいので私の理解が正しいかわからないけど、\n全てはバイナリ列。文字列と言うのはバイナリ列を一定のルールで解釈しただけに過ぎない。端末はバイナリ列を受け取って、特別な意味を持つ並び(エスケープシーケンス)だったらそれに沿った処理をし、それ以外は文字列として解釈して画面に出す\nみたいな感じじゃないかな","ts":"1620646394.412200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g4bF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc87b609-8d4e-49af-b33f-1dc0bfbd8612","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"と思うようにしてる(自分)というのはありますが、もちろん強制じゃないのでイメージや理解によって変るとは思います。","ts":"1620646325.411200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tc9bW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8745E047-215E-4D4C-A22C-B02064B7D257","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"プロセスの出力のバイト列はそのままWEBソケットに載せてるので、そうなると文字コードがどうこうじゃないって話か","ts":"1620646230.408000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sRm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65E915E4-B00A-45D7-BC2B-22DF222794D4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどぉ","ts":"1620646169.406400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xMJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87d10345-5bbc-4117-83db-d4a5eddd28d9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"エスケープ、だけじゃないかもしれないけど(自分も理解が浅い\u0026amp;狭いだろうし)\nただESCは対応する印刷可能文字はないので、一応","ts":"1620646045.406100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZlDO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa39b1dd-279e-44cf-a846-aab8cdeacbdf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"文字、なのは大体あってるけど概念は広いので、端末に1byteづつ送っていって、文字だったら文字が出るし、ASCIIでいうところのエスケープからつづくバイト列がくると端末が特有の機能を出す、と考えてたほうがいいと思います。\nASCIIの範囲にほぼすべて文字が割り当ってるから、文字というほうがいいか?","ts":"1620645854.405200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N2T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E809FF66-C3C1-41BC-B291-75C2C3936F28","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ansiって文字列と思ってるんですが、そうじゃないですか？\nやたらと変な記号の組み合わせで色を出したりしてる認識です","ts":"1620645451.403000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"neA02"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bd9ee66-7e4d-4ca5-a024-bdb239614163","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"それ自体はまあ大体はいいんでは\nescapeは普通の文字も混ってることに注意(ってわかってるだろうけど)","ts":"1620645271.401700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZCJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc1f9cc0-693d-45ff-b1e0-57f83fa2d013","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"まず、\nprocess -\u0026gt; escape -\u0026gt; terminal\nこんなイメージですが、合っていますか？","ts":"1620645180.400500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kcm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70479a80-9fea-416b-a45c-892189e70ff2","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ふむふむ","ts":"1620645097.399800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CaPs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dddbf60-5b19-4e58-b7e0-46e999fb9032","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"それぞれレイヤが違う、みたいな","ts":"1620645094.399600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2JI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55b0531e-5066-40b7-9f94-c76d9419d345","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"unicodeは文字の集合、UTF-8は符号化コード、ansi escapeは端末で実現する機能のためのキーコードの並び、くらいでいいかな?","ts":"1620645080.399300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CGAw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fae92dd-8cd3-44ec-8071-567ffa0bb6b0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"エスケープに割り当たってるキーコード、hogeのキーコード....とつづくようなもので\nそれ自体は文字コードとは関係付ける必要のないものだと思うので","ts":"1620645001.398000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VIo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb030b10-08f0-4069-ae68-76b225599fb4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"端末が受けつけるansi escapeはつまるところansi escapeなコードであって文字コードとは関係ないと思います","ts":"1620644944.396700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uET1x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9443d411-bae1-417c-bbf7-d21c0b8cdabb","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ちょっとふわっとした質問で申し訳ないんですが、\nプロセスが出力しているansi escapeってunicodeでしょうか？\n\u003chttp://github.com/creack/pty|github.com/creack/pty\u003e を使って、プロセスの出力をwebsocketを通してブラウザに送っていますが、VimといったTUIを使うと↓のエラーがよく起きるんで、\nasniはutf8に変換しないと行けないのかなぁと\n```failed: Could not decode a text frame as UTF-8.```","ts":"1620644705.395900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hcgl"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U0219NGHW8M","text":"\u003c@U0219NGHW8M\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1620630581.393100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"a1de70e2-c103-4273-ae8b-e066e0eb2288","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"今おもいだしたけど、関数にくくり出して事故ったことあった。","ts":"1620629281.392800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q8P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bec0bc6-a268-4fbd-ab75-dca58f35e9ed","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"なので、元の\n```inoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;cr\u0026gt; pumvisible() ? \"\\\u0026lt;C-y\u0026gt;\" : \"\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\"```\nは\n```inoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;cr\u0026gt; pumvisible() ? '\u0026lt;C-y\u0026gt;' : '\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;'```\nと書くほうが筋がいい気がする","ts":"1620629268.392600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nEV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32d7848d-3d9c-4e05-86e3-4aab2c353d51","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"`\u0026lt;xxx\u0026gt;` 記法の展開は `\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;` による文字列評価よりも前に行われるところがミソですね。\n`\u0026lt;xxx\u0026gt;` 記法の展開は map コマンドの実行時に、`\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;` による文字列評価は定義した map の実行時に行われるイメージ","ts":"1620629172.390900","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1620629380.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kanzenrikai","count":1,"users":["UP6PA1UBE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hauaX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a108f7d2-f367-4ffd-8d74-55449a4d7e42","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"`\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;` だから通常の式の展開かと思ったら直感とちょっと違った","ts":"1620629047.389500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jCkoS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"669d9477-507b-4b8f-af6d-fad7b6171420","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"直接書かなかった部分、関数に切り出して関数を呼んだ場合は関数内は当然 `:map` の文脈ではないので `\"\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\"` のように書く必要がある","ts":"1620627683.388300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":3,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","UP6PA1UBE","U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Errb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9ba1b43-6a1a-4233-a197-9250c6143c59","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"単に `:map` の引数に直接書いた部分の `\u0026lt;\u0026gt;` 記法はそのまま展開される、というだけですね。例えそれが `\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;` だったとしても","ts":"1620627625.387600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VDmiW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"945462d6-54b1-41d7-8766-9e4fd9908001","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"まあ一応まじでいいところあげるとすると、フォーマッターあるところとLSPで補完できるところですかね・・・\n設定関数さえもう少しまともな使い勝手になればって感じはあります。。。","ts":"1620627173.386400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LdG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1e3607e-881c-4e1f-8549-3b86c19ccace","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"lua 移行の苦労に対するリターン（見返り）は、リターン（改行）が楽になったことぐらい、ってなわけですね。うまい","ts":"1620626851.384700","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1620626958.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":3,"users":["UP6PA1UBE","U9S4G0LJW","U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qC6cx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c182eccf-051e-464b-8707-7767803befeb","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"lua移行は今の所辛いことしかありません(改行が楽なくらいかな)\nまあ絶賛開発中の部分ですから我慢しますが、","ts":"1620626715.384500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0QQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cfa1860-f884-4432-bc39-01232ff62f6d","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"map-\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; では不要だが `feedkeys()` では必要だと思う","ts":"1620626063.383300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9vr02"}]},{"client_msg_id":"106d447f-4f49-426e-8d3d-5b470511fa92","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"init.luaトラブルばかりな印象ある","ts":"1620626019.382700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZPmQz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd8548ad-9180-4d06-9d9c-1c42a28834eb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ここらへんの条件もよくわからない...","ts":"1620625993.382600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JOnx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"515f4f41-9f7f-438c-bdc1-303e75629415","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"例では `\"\\\u0026lt;Ignore\u0026gt;\"` と書かれていて必要そうに見えるが、実際書いてみると `\\` 無しで動きますね","ts":"1620625939.382400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=2z"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *:map-\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;* *:map-expression*\nマップや短縮入力を定義するときに \"\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;\" 引数を指定すると、引数が式 (スクリプ\nト) として扱われます。マップが実行されたときに、式が評価され、その値が {rhs}\nとして使われます。例:  \n        :inoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; . InsertDot()\nInsertDot() 関数の戻り値が挿入されます。カーソルの前のテキストをチェックして、\nある条件に一致するなら omni 補完を開始する、というようなことができます。\n \n短縮入力では、入力されて短縮入力展開のトリガーとなった文字が |v:char| にセット\nされます。これを使って {lhs} の展開方法を決めることもできます。自分で v:char\nを挿入したり変更したりすべきではありません。\n \nマッピングで何も実行させない場合は、評価結果が空文字列になるようにします。も\nし、なんからの{訳註:状態などの}変更で Vim がメインループを通過する必要があるも\nのなら (例えば、画面の更新など)、\"\\\u0026lt;Ignore\u0026gt;\" を返すようにします。\nこれは、\"何もしない\" と同義ですが Vim はループから入力待ちに戻ります。例:  \n        func s:OpenPopup()\n          call popup_create(... arguments ...)\n          return \"\\\u0026lt;Ignore\u0026gt;\"\n        endfunc\n        nnoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;F3\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Sid\u0026gt;OpenPopup()\n \n副作用に注意してください。式は文字の取得中に評価されるため、簡単に異常動作を起\nこせてしまいます。そのため、次のものは制限されます:\n- バッファのテキストの変更 |textlock|。\n- 他のバッファの編集。\n- |:normal| コマンド。\n- カーソルの移動は可能ですが、後で元に戻されます。\n以上のことを実現したい場合は、そのためのコマンド文字列を返してください。もしく\nは代わりに |\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;| マッピングを使用してください。\n \ngetchar() が使用できます。先行入力があればそれが消費されます。例えば次のような\nマップを定義します:  \n  inoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-L\u0026gt; nr2char(getchar())\n  inoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-L\u0026gt;x \"foo\"\nそして CTRL-L を押してみます。すぐには何も起きません。どのマップを使うかを決定\nするためには文字がもう一つ必要です。次に 'x' を押すと後者のマップが使われ、\n\"foo\" が挿入されます。他のキーを押すと前者のマップが使われ、その文字が\ngetchar() によって取得され、返されます。\n \n例を示します。リスト番号を自動的に増加させつつ挿入します:  \n        let counter = 0\n        inoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-L\u0026gt; ListItem()\n        inoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-R\u0026gt; ListReset()\n \n        func ListItem()\n          let g:counter += 1\n          return g:counter . '. '\n        endfunc\n \n        func ListReset()\n          let g:counter = 0\n          return ''\n        endfunc\n \nCTRL-L で次の番号を挿入し、CTRL-R で番号をリセットします。CTRL-R は空文字列を\n返すので、何も挿入されません。\n \nNote: テキストの末尾以外で 0x80 をシングルバイトとして使った場合、それは機能し\nません。特殊キーとして認識されます。\n```","ts":"1620625874.381500","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"2593baed-cdbb-4262-af86-844351cd2c78","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":":help map-\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;","ts":"1620625873.381400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RAa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a0162f5-6eec-45a3-a6e8-8c6f51603552","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"nvim のことはわからないですが、これが :map の引数に直接渡るならバックスラッシュはなくていい気がします。","ts":"1620623555.381100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IRa5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"480075f3-490b-46f8-9f03-afeaa06e8ee2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なくして動いたのは謎","ts":"1620623271.380300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WfbtF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9fa8a45-582c-4213-bb58-617b05669b56","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"map の `\"\\\u0026lt;C-y\u0026gt;\"`  などは、\u0026lt;C-y\u0026gt;のキーコードそのものに化ける、だからだと思われますが\nluaからだと\\\\にすべきでしょうねえ","ts":"1620623264.380100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fhKsK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"613682b6-d083-4b5c-afcb-a5e67750775e","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"たしかに\\\\でもいけました","ts":"1620623234.379400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tea"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d9e9a46-8dee-4678-a9f1-16e85bc21c10","type":"message","user":"UJ70JTGR3","text":"\u003chttps://oroques.dev/notes/neovim-init/\u003e\nここの例だとバックスラッシュを二つにするのが正しそうです","ts":"1620623103.378400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Neovim 0.5 features and the switch to init.lua","id":1,"title":"Neovim 0.5 features and the switch to init.lua","title_link":"https://oroques.dev/notes/neovim-init/","text":"My personal website.","blocks":null,"service_name":"oroques.dev","service_icon":"https://oroques.dev/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://oroques.dev/notes/neovim-init/","original_url":"h